scripten 4.0.18 and keep the log.\n\nScope: this FAIL concerns the automated port build task only. Manual playthrough items (door and switch activation, OS focus, speakers, musical fidelity, save persistence, mouse aiming) and the full-assignment items (autonomous repair, resumption, teammate exercise NOT PERFORMED) are not covered and were not assessed.",
